    "4:ז": "(g) Only that there are cracks in it - R.L. and M.B.A. above, a flame in the same place, i.e., there are burning larvaes that are quite six of them there until a straw burned on him from the outside, which is surely burned down all the pretexts and walls:",
    "4:ח": "(d) A rash should be insulted - it is a tool that has feet and puts on it a cadar or a pan in a oven on the light all year and if you want to use it on the Passover, it must be clouded in the light that sometimes we pour a veil on it and swallow a taste of light. And this is only a snail because of the matter, he has truly rejected two bowls concerning this one, and he has no escape from the other as a buffer in the U.S. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .\nIn retrospect, even if we use it without insulting at all, it should not be prohibited:",
