    "23:ג": "And then, if you do not listen to me, you will not be able to do it, and there is no way to do it with green or white soils, and even if it were part of the earth, it is not possible to swallow it up and if it is not a place in the city, and if it is not a place in the city, it is not allowed to swallow it\nAnd then, he said, “..",
