    "26:ה": "(k) as well as the custom – and if it were most of it, it would be adopted in the order, and now we will use it with a sensitivity without the talent. And if most of them were to be treated with a snail or even a cold, but most of the times through the stay of a buffer in it above, then in retrospect, it is forbidden to use it as an A.C. And with a lot of loss, Oded has to make it easier if he was another above the “he gives a taste for the defect:",
    "26:ו": "(156) And in these countries — nevertheless in a place where glass vessels are not available and one has no cups and other vessels, Chayei Adam wrote one may rely to be lenient to clean them very well and kasher through pouring three days; and this applies specifically to vessels whose mouths are wide from above; but bottles whose mouths are narrow from above and sediment adheres at their bottom and one cannot insert hands inside to clean them well — and likewise any vessel into which one cannot insert one's hand — they have no remedy to kasher them. And even regarding cups, in a place where new ones can be bought — one should not change the custom they practiced not to use them.",
